    {
      "_comment": "Each rule: when ALL conditions in `when` hold, append `addTags` and `note`. Conditions: top2HasAll (both metros in the top-2), primaryState/pointState (seed stateOrProvince vs the point's soft-border side), primaryCountry/pointCountry, primaryTagIn, repeaterTypeIn (only evaluated once a repeater type is chosen, e.g. high-site-only good-neighbor tags).",
