      "when": { "top2HasAll": ["geg", "cda"] },
      "addTags": ["inw"],
      "note": "Cross-border Inland Northwest tag (inw) added — Spokane and Coeur d'Alene share the inw region (parent: pnw). Some legacy repeaters may instead (or also) carry the older ie tag for interoperability; it is no longer part of new recommendations."
    },
