      "when": { "primaryTagIn": ["puw"] },
      "addTags": ["inw", "palouse", "e-wa"],
      "note": "Pullman (WA side of the Palouse) dual-carries inw and the cross-border palouse tag it shares with Moscow, ID, plus e-wa as a tie back to the rest of Eastern Washington."
    },
